  Vendor dashboard script order (do not reorder casually):
  1. CDN libs (html5-qrcode, supabase-js) — third-party, no project deps
  2. Foundation: supabase-client → store → utils → location-picker → dashboard-state
  3. Shared helpers: vendor-location, doha-clock
